.TH LDAP-CONFIG-AUDIT 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ldap-config-audit \- openldap client tls configuration review
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ldap-config-audit
[options] [--help | --version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read-only inspection of one OpenLDAP ldap.conf for weak TLS_REQCERT policy, malformed directives and informational LDAP URI schemes. Does not print values, follow includes, inspect LDAPRC or connect to a server.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file PATH
Read an explicit OpenLDAP configuration file instead of the platform default.
.TP
.B --help
Display help and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Display version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success/clean; 1 unsuccessful/finding; 2 invalid arguments; 3 missing prerequisites or unexpected errors.
.SH SECURITY
Only read-only checks. Query tools can send network traffic; configure only authorized targets.
